Original unchanged test replay: 12 default runs plus four environment controls.
  strptime/strtold/wordexp/powf: both archives retain the original failures.
  atfork: root fails, uid 65534 passes with both archives (no assertion change).
  daemon-failure: both default and 1024-fd controls PASS with both archives;
